  "title": "Grab set to pilot on-demand autonomous vehicle service in Punggol, advancing regional hybrid mobility strategy",
  "summary": "Singapore, 29 July 2026 – Grab will be launching an on-demand autonomous vehicle (AV) trial in Punggol. Under this pilot service, riders will be able to book their own dedicated AVs to travel between pick-up and drop-off points currently served by Grab’s AV shuttle service, taking the most direct route instead of following a fixed shuttle loop.",
